Subtask 3.4: Understanding Route Components in Detail
Key Camel Concepts Demonstrated
Endpoints:

File Endpoint: file:directory?options
Timer Endpoint: timer:name?period=milliseconds
Enterprise Integration Patterns:

Message Router: Routes messages based on content
Content-Based Router: Uses choice() and when() clauses
Message Translator: Transforms message content
DSL Elements:

from(): Defines the starting point (consumer)
to(): Defines the destination (producer)
log(): Adds logging capability
choice(): Implements conditional routing
transform(): Modifies message content
Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Files Not Being Processed
Problem: Files remain in the input directory Solution:

Check file permissions: chmod 644 data/input/*
Verify directory exists: ls -la data/input/
Remove noop=true option to move files instead of copying
Issue 2: Application Won't Start
Problem: Maven compilation errors Solution:

# Clean and rebuild
mvn clean compile

# Check Java version
java -version

# Verify dependencies
mvn dependency:tree
Issue 3: No Log Output Visible
Problem: Missing log messages Solution: Create src/main/resources/simplelogger.properties:

org.slf4j.simpleLogger.defaultLogLevel=INFO
org.slf4j.simpleLogger.showDateTime=true
org.slf4j.simpleLogger.dateTimeFormat=yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss
